IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `wra-core`
IMPORT `wra2-sch`

-- wra2-tests-sch.l4: tests for Schedules 3, 7 and 8.
-- Expected values are written from the text of the Act (inputs/ukpga-2012-5.txt lines 2923-3000 and 3174-3236), not from the output.

§ `Schedule 3: CSPSSA 70A`
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(1) the grant is made in the instalments, at the times, in the manner and subject to the conditions the order provides` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(1) the grant is made in the instalments, at the times, in the manner and subject to the conditions the order provides` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(1) the grant is made in the instalments, at the times, in the manner and subject to the conditions the order provides` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(2) the Secretary of State may estimate the amount of grant payable to the authority` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(2) the Secretary of State may estimate the amount of grant payable to the authority` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(2) the Secretary of State may estimate the amount of grant payable to the authority` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(3) the Secretary of State may recover the whole or part of the payment from the authority` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(3) the Secretary of State may recover the whole or part of the payment from the authority` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(3) the Secretary of State may recover the whole or part of the payment from the authority` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(3) the Secretary of State may recover the whole or part of the payment from the authority` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(4) the sum may be recovered by withholding or reducing subsidy` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(4) the sum may be recovered by withholding or reducing subsidy` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(5) an order under section 70A may be made at that time` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(5) before the end of the period to which the order relates` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(5) an order under section 70A may be made at that time` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(5) during the period to which the order relates` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(5) an order under section 70A may be made at that time` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(5) after the end of the period to which the order relates` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(5) an order under section 70A may be made at that time` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(5) some other time` EQUALS NOTHING
-- lines 2953-2954: the amount of a grant is determined in accordance with an order made by the Secretary of State with the consent of the Treasury
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70(2) the amount of a grant is determined in accordance with the order` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70(2) the amount of a grant is determined in accordance with the order` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- line 2970: section 70(5) to (7) applies to orders under section 70A
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(7) the provision of section 70 applies to orders under section 70A` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(7) section 70(5)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(7) the provision of section 70 applies to orders under section 70A` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(7) section 70(6)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(7) the provision of section 70 applies to orders under section 70A` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(7) section 70(7)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(7) the provision of section 70 applies to orders under section 70A` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(7) some other provision of section 70` EQUALS NOTHING

