§ `defined terms (pointers)`
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA what the term means` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 69(7) local authority (section 69)` EQUALS "the meaning given by section 191 of the Social Security Administration Act 1992"
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA what the term means` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70(8) local authority (section 70)` EQUALS "the same meaning as in section 69"
#ASSERT `Sch 3 CSPSSA what the term means` `Sch 3 CSPSSA 70A(6) local authority (section 70A)` EQUALS "the same meaning as in section 69"
#ASSERT `Sch 7 JSA 35(1) what the term means` `Sch 7 JSA 35(1) jobseeker's direction` EQUALS "the meaning given by section 19A"
